ps2xIOP: implement ioman open/close/read/write/lseek (read-only, over the
IopHost file API) so IOP drivers can stream from cdrom0:, and rate-limit the
"unhandled import" warning. Raw Danger's IREMSND2 loads its sound banks this way.

